  "description": "Choose the Claude account headline at now (ADR 0002), not the smallest figure on screen. Exclude any window with a reset at or before now if it was fetched strictly before that reset or has no fetch time. If this excludes every window, keep all. If the remaining pool contains a global window, only globals compete. A provider-declared exhausted window or exactly zero left wins; otherwise choose the lowest known raw remaining percentage, unknown last. On a tie keep the first in provider-window order. No windows means no headline. Use the chosen window's last reported raw percentage left, never the rounded screen figure or its Used complement. Exhausted is Asleep even with a positive or absent figure. Otherwise, missing, non-finite or out-of-range (below 0 or above 100) is unknown and gives Idle; 0 is Asleep; (0,20] Tired; (20,50] Working; (50,90] Idle; (90,100] Dancing. Stale age, ordinary failure, rate-limit pause, reset due and expired sign-in never erase an actual cached figure or declared exhaustion: inspect the retained windows as supplied and apply the same headline rule. A reset due can change which headline wins, but a passed clock boundary is not evidence of a refill. With no retained headline, the mood is Idle. Reading status and display mode do not adjust the rule. Hooray is not a steady mood; never derive it from this fixture. Expectations are hand-written and contain no localized text.",
  "schema": "vectors: array of { name: unique nonempty string, now: epoch ms, fetchedAt: epoch ms or null, reading: current|stale|failed|paused|expired|unread, windows: provider-order array of { id: unique nonempty string, scope: global|model|unknown, remainingPercent: JSON number or null, exhausted: boolean (provider flag), resetAt: epoch ms or null }, expected: { headlineId: string or null, mood: asleep|tired|working|idle|dancing } }. All keys are required, including nullable ones. Reading describes the fixture, not an input to rank or pose; paused corresponds to a stored failure with the existing rate-limit pause marker, expired to expired sign-in, unread to no retained windows. Run every case in both Left and Used.",
